    "sourcePrompt": "Biographics-style QUOTE CARDS — two sequential quote cards in one 10-second video. 1920x1080, SILENT. No audio.\n\nRoot: <div id=\"scene\" style=\"width:1920px;height:1080px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;background:#0a0a0c;\">\n\n## Shared structure\nTwo quote cards play back-to-back, each 5 seconds. Each card: background video + solid dark overlay + single large quote text centered. NO small text, NO attribution line, NO decorative elements other than what's specified.\n\n---\n\n## CARD 1 (0–5s) — Doctor Strange quote\n\n### Background video (z-index:1)\n<video autoplay muted loop playsinline style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;z-index:1;opacity:0.30;\">\n  <source src=\"{{bgVid1}}\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n</video>\n\n### Solid color overlay (z-index:2)\n<div id=\"overlay1\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:2;background:rgba(12,8,20,0.82);\"></div>\n\n### Quote text (z-index:10)\n<div id=\"q1\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:10;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 160px;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n  <p style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;font-style:italic;color:#f0ece4;text-align:center;line-height:1.25;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.01em;\">\n    \"Dormammu,<br>I've come to bargain.\"\n  </p>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## CARD 2 (5–10s) — Sherlock quote\n\n### Background video (z-index:1) — swap src at t=5s via JS\n<div id=\"bg2wrap\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:1;opacity:0;overflow:hidden;\">\n  <video id=\"vid2\" autoplay muted loop playsinline style=\"width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;opacity:0.30;\">\n    <source src=\"{{bgVid2}}\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n  </video>\n</div>\n\n### Solid overlay card 2 (z-index:2)\n<div id=\"overlay2\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:2;background:rgba(8,12,18,0.84);opacity:0;\"></div>\n\n### Quote text card 2 (z-index:10)\n<div id=\"q2\" style=\"position:absolute;top:0;left:0;width:100%;height:100%;z-index:10;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:0 160px;box-sizing:border-box;opacity:0;\">\n  <p style=\"font-family:'Playfair Display',Georgia,serif;font-size:64px;font-weight:700;font-style:italic;color:#f0ece4;text-align:center;line-height:1.25;margin:0;letter-spacing:0.01em;\">\n    \"Elementary,<br>my dear Watson.\"\n  </p>\n</div>\n\n---\n\n## Google Fonts\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,700;1,400&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n## GSAP animation\n<script src=\"vendor/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n<script>\nwindow.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function() {\n\n  // Card 1 — fade in quote text\n  gsap.set(\"#q1\", { opacity: 0, y: 16 });\n  gsap.set(\"#overlay1\", { opacity: 0 });\n\n  const tl = gsap.timeline();\n\n  // Card 1 in\n  tl.to(\"#overlay1\", { opacity: 1, duration: 0.5, ease: \"power2.out\" }, 0.0)\n    .to(\"#q1\", { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 0.7, ease: \"power3.out\" }, 0.4)\n\n  // Card 1 out + Card 2 in (crossfade at t=4.3s)\n    .to(\"#q1\",       { opacity: 0, y: -10, duration: 0.55, ease: \"power2.in\" }, 4.3)\n    .to(\"#overlay1\", { opacity: 0, duration: 0.55, ease: \"power2.in\" }, 4.3)\n    .to(\"#bg2wrap\",  { opacity: 1, duration: 0.55, ease: \"power2.out\" }, 4.3)\n    .to(\"#overlay2\", { opacity: 1, duration: 0.55, ease: \"power2.out\" }, 4.3)\n    .to(\"#q2\",       { opacity: 1, y: 0, duration: 0.7, ease: \"power3.out\" }, 4.75)\n\n  // Card 2 out\n    .to(\"#q2\",       { opacity: 0, y: -10, duration: 0.55, ease: \"power2.in\" }, 9.2)\n    .to(\"#overlay2\", { opacity: 0, duration: 0.55, ease: \"power2.in\" }, 9.2);\n\n  // Init card 2 elements\n  gsap.set(\"#q2\",       { opacity: 0, y: 16 });\n  gsap.set(\"#bg2wrap\",  { opacity: 0 });\n  gsap.set(\"#overlay2\", { opacity: 0 });\n\n});\n</script>\n\n## CRITICAL\n- z-index: bg videos=1, overlays=2, quote text=10\n- NO attribution, NO small text, NO decorative lines — pure overlay + big quote only\n- Both quotes are fictional character lines from Benedict Cumberbatch's roles\n- Fully silent",
